    "Indexed path requires a validated MobiPEG front table and supported single MobiClip stream. Unknown formats retain forward decoding.",
    "Interleaved stereo requires an even-frame intra start with the following eye also intra. No verified start within the bounded search retains the safe fallback.",
    "Timings are machine-specific. Browser worker measurements separate engine warmup; actual slider is recorded independently.",
    "Scene analysis samples source luma at two short locations per range; it is not exhaustive shot analysis or optical flow.",
    "At the same 800000-byte cap, more budget is used and difficult-scene PSNR improves. At matched actual bytes, the measured quality ties a manually retuned uniform baseline. No general equal-byte quality gain is claimed.",
    "Budget redistribution applies to queued work; in-flight caps remain reserved. Completion order can affect later caps.",
    "Desktop scene allocation applies to segmented parallel size-target jobs; the existing single-process short path is preserved.",
    "Physical iPhone, physical 3DS and native macOS execution were not tested.",
    "No new Azahar run was needed: player executable, CIA format, muxer and codec implementations are unchanged. Existing Azahar evidence remains the baseline.",
    "Portable archives rebuilt locally; existing GitHub release assets have not been replaced."
  ],
